        "description": {
            "value": "<p>You transmute scrap metal into a shotgun blast of high-purity precious metals. Creatures in the area take 1d8 piercing damage with a basic Reflex save. The damage counts as cold iron or silver (chosen when you Cast the Spell). The spell gains no benefits from the chosen material except for determining immunities, resistances, and weaknesses.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> The damage increases to 3d8.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> The damage increases to 6d8, and you can also choose to have the damage count as adamantine, cold iron, or silver.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (7th)</strong> As 5th-rank, and increase the damage to 9d8.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (9th)</strong> The damage increases to 12d8, and you can choose to have the damage count as any precious metal.</p>"
        },
